tests.user_message:
Find all bugs: wrong function names, invalid cast usage, null comparison issues, invalid ++ usage on record fields.

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    integer age = toInteger($in.0.age_string);
    decimal price = cast($in.0.gross_price, decimal);
    if ($in.0.score < null) { return SKIP; }
    $out.0.counter++;
    $out.0.age = age;
    $out.0.price = price;
    return ALL;
}
```

